<title>USA: Sioux Falls hogs up $0.75 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls hogs up $0.75 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said barrows and gilts were $0.75 higher. Trading was moderate. Top $59.75 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    220-260 lbs   59.25-59.75</p>
<p>		  260-270 lbs   58.75-59.25</p>
<p>    US 2-3    270-280 lbs   57.75-58.75</p>
<p>		  280-290 lbs   56.75-57.75</p>
<p>    US 3-4    290-300 lbs   55.75-56.75</p>
<p>Sows - up $1.00-3.00. Top $51.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>    US 1-3    300-450 lbs    47.50-48.00</p>
<p>		  450-500 lbs    50.00</p>
<p>		  500-650 lbs    unevenly 51.00-56.00, later</p>
<p>mostly 51.00</p>
</text>
